sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant K as Redpanda
  participant OC as order-service<br/>PaymentEventsConsumer
  participant IC as inventory-service<br/>PaymentEventsConsumer
  participant R as Redis
  participant IDB as inventory_db
  K->>OC: payment.failed { orderId, reason }
  OC->>OC: CancelOrderCommand(reason = "PAYMENT_FAILED: <reason>")<br/>PENDING → CANCELLED + outbox(order.cancelled)
  K->>IC: payment.failed { orderId, items }
  IC->>R: findByOrderId → reservation
  alt reservation still RESERVED
    IC->>R: atomic_release.lua (reserved − q, DEL hash, ZREM expiry)
    IC->>IDB: ledger RELEASED + counters
  else gone (expired / released) or COMMITTED
    IC->>IC: nothing to do
  end
